// A small, valid tree for the dump chain (ast/dump): a num leaf (node 1), an
// ident leaf (node 2), and a call node (node 3, built in dump_tail.id) whose
// a/b genuinely point at those two -- unlike ast/node/known.id's node, whose
// a/b/c are plain numbers with no node behind them, which the dump functions
// cannot walk.

ast_dump_setup() {
  ast_init();
  ast_dump_mark();
} return void;
